  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.4277954101562,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "is provided in the operational handbook, to ensure that the lack of paediatric-specific formulations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        196.89749145507812,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "does not hinder treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        111.43463897705078,
        190.875732421875,
        127.09464263916016
      ],
      "text": "People living with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        134.30250549316406,
        527.4135131835938,
        148.74549865722656
      ],
      "text": "The study included PLHIV regardless of their immunologic status. HIV was diagnosed in 98 (14.1%)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        147.5025177001953,
        527.38037109375,
        161.9455108642578
      ],
      "text": "people enrolled in the endTB trial, with 15 enrolled to BLMZ, 14 to BLLfxCZ, 17 to BDLLfxZ and 19 in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        160.70252990722656,
        527.4035034179688,
        175.14552307128906
      ],
      "text": "the control arm. Provided that suppressive antiretroviral therapy is given, similar efficacy should be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        173.9025421142578,
        310.053466796875,
        188.3455352783203
      ],
      "text": "expected (stratified analyses largely supported this).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        204.7462921142578,
        269.50933837890625,
        220.40628051757812
      ],
      "text": "Pregnant and breastfeeding women",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        227.6143341064453,
        527.56298828125,
        242.0573272705078
      ],
      "text": "There were no data from the endTB trial on using the recommended regimens in pregnant and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        240.81422424316406,
        527.4331665039062,
        255.25721740722656
      ],
      "text": "breastfeeding women. Other studies support that MDR/RR-TB can be managed during pregnancy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        252.73829650878906,
        527.4258422851562,
        268.4573059082031
      ],
      "text": "(67, 68) with caution regarding the drugs used in BLMZ, BLLfxCZ, and BDLLfxZ  . Close monitoring",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        267.2142333984375,
        527.400146484375,
        281.6572570800781
      ],
      "text": "and systematic collection of data from pregnant, breastfeeding and post-partum patients will offer",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        280.4141845703125,
        527.4244384765625,
        294.8572082519531
      ],
      "text": "valuable insights into treatment outcomes, thereby contributing to safer, evidence-based care for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        293.61431884765625,
        231.96217346191406,
        308.0573425292969
      ],
      "text": "pregnant women with MDR/RR-TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        324.4580993652344,
        174.74769592285156,
        340.11810302734375
      ],
      "text": "Extrapulmonary TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        347.3260192871094,
        527.3956909179688,
        361.76904296875
      ],
      "text": "The endTB trial enrolled participants with extrapulmonary TB if they also had pulmonary TB; no specific",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.953149795532227,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        360.5260925292969,
        527.43994140625,
        374.9691162109375
      ],
      "text": "analysis could be performed for participants with extrapulmonary TB. However, the GDG felt that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        373.72601318359375,
        527.3748779296875,
        388.1690368652344
      ],
      "text": "extrapolation to extrapulmonary TB and other forms of TB was warranted except in cases involving",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        386.9261169433594,
        527.1866455078125,
        401.369140625
      ],
      "text": "severe forms of TB that may require special treatment arrangements and decisions, particularly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        400.1260986328125,
        527.4354248046875,
        414.5691223144531
      ],
      "text": "TB involving the CNS, osteoarticular and disseminated forms of TB. Thus, the recommendation of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        413.3260192871094,
        527.4312133789062,
        427.76904296875
      ],
      "text": "the BLMZ, BLLfxCZ and BDLLfxZ regimens applies to people with pulmonary TB and all forms of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        426.5260925292969,
        524.1425170898438,
        440.9691162109375
      ],
      "text": "extrapulmonary TB except for TB involving the CNS, and osteoarticular and disseminated forms of TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97602367401123,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        457.3699035644531,
        184.57810974121094,
        473.0299072265625
      ],
      "text": "Other considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        480.23779296875,
        527.4835815429688,
        494.6808166503906
      ],
      "text": "Several other patient groups were evaluated in the endTB trial. Excluded from enrolment were people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97983169555664,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.4378967285156,
        527.5670166015625,
        507.88092041015625
      ],
      "text": "with anaemia, uncorrectable electrolyte disorders, renal dysfunction, liver dysfunction AST, ALT or total",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.971112251281738,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        506.637939453125,
        527.451904296875,
        521.0809326171875
      ],
      "text": "bilirubin at least three times the upper limit of normal, with cardiac risk factors, a QTcF above 450 ms",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        519.837890625,
        527.2265014648438,
        534.2808837890625
      ],
      "text": "and other Grade 4 results. These groups of patients may still receive the regimens if the treating",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        533.0379028320312,
        430.8719787597656,
        547.4808959960938
      ],
      "text": "physician considers it the best option despite these possible contraindications.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        554.7418212890625,
        527.3749389648438,
        569.184814453125
      ],
      "text": "Participants with diabetes, regardless of their HbA1c levels, could be enrolled. The panel found no",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        567.9417724609375,
        527.5578002929688,
        582.384765625
      ],
      "text": "evidence suggesting different conclusions for this group compared with the overall recommendations.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.964592933654785,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        595.7589721679688,
        245.23455810546875,
        611.6110229492188
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        627.9589233398438,
        160.5745086669922,
        643.6189575195312
      ],
      "text": "Patient selection",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        650.8267822265625,
        527.5932006835938,
        665.269775390625
      ],
      "text": "Eligibility for the three modified 9-month regimens is outlined under remarks on Recommendation 2.2.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.95711612701416,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        664.0267944335938,
        527.4156494140625,
        678.4697875976562
      ],
      "text": "The regimens are considered for the treatment of patients with MDR/RR-TB in whom resistance to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        677.2269287109375,
        527.4859008789062,
        691.669921875
      ],
      "text": "FQ has been excluded, and who cannot be offered any of the two recommended 6-month regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999800682067871,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.1508178710938,
        282.0423889160156,
        704.8698120117188
      ],
      "text": "(69) (see consolidated operational handbook  ).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        712.1307983398438,
        527.1103515625,
        726.5737915039062
      ],
      "text": "The regimens are suitable for patients with pulmonary or all forms of extrapulmonary TB disease, except",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        725.330810546875,
        522.7737426757812,
        739.7738037109375
      ],
      "text": "for TB involving the CNS, osteoarticular, or disseminated forms of TB with multiorgan involvement.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        39.172698974609375,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "112 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        326.14483642578125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Module 4: treatment and care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
